  "summary": "An actor tracked as skynox7 compromises internet-facing edge devices (D-Link ShareCenter NAS, Ubiquiti UniFi Video NVR, SAP NetWeaver Visual Composer, plus DVR/NVR brands like Hikvision and Dahua) via known CVEs and installs the Pawns.app proxyware CLI to proxyjacking their bandwidth. At least 143 devices in 34 countries were compromised; in some cases the actor also drops an SSH public key into root and ubnt authorized_keys files as backup access. The download-and-execute chain uses /bin/sh, curl, /tmp/gs and a DONE callback beacon to an attacker-controlled IP.",
  "mitre_techniques": [
    "T1190",
    "T1210",
    "T1059.004",
    "T1105",
    "T1098.004",
    "T1496",
    "T1090"
  ],
